DocRED zero-shot beam evaluates on a 50-document subset (compute cost; LoRA beam uses the full 998-document set).
Total latency: 1.54$\times$ (beam 1.32$\times$ $+$ constraint 1.17$\times$; Table~\ref{tab:beam-latency}).

